{"sectionId":"acid/acid-base","items":[{"id":"acid--acid-base-k001","sectionId":"acid/acid-base","unitId":"acid","subject":"chemistry","text":"Arrhenius 산·염기는 수용액 H⁺·OH⁻ 증가, Brønsted–Lowry 산·염기는 양성자 공여·수용, Lewis 산·염기는 전자쌍 수용·공여로 정의한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"acid--acid-base-k002","sectionId":"acid/acid-base","unitId":"acid","subject":"chemistry","text":"물의 자동이온화 Kw=aH⁺aOH⁻이며 25℃에서 약 10⁻¹⁴이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"acid--acid-base-k003","sectionId":"acid/acid-base","unitId":"acid","subject":"chemistry","text":"중성은 [H⁺]=[OH⁻]에 해당하고 pH 7은 25℃ 근사다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"acid--acid-base-k004","sectionId":"acid/acid-base","unitId":"acid","subject":"chemistry","text":"Ka=[H⁺][A⁻]/[HA]의 묽은용액 근사, Kb와 짝산 Ka는 KaKb=Kw이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"acid--acid-base-k005","sectionId":"acid/acid-base","unitId":"acid","subject":"chemistry","text":"단양성자 약산 초기농도 C에서 해리량 x는 Ka=x²/(C−x)로 구하며 x≪C이면 x≈√(KaC)이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"acid--acid-base-k006","sectionId":"acid/acid-base","unitId":"acid","subject":"chemistry","text":"근사가 부적절하면 이차방정식 또는 물 자동이온화를 포함한 균형식을 사용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"acid--acid-base-k007","sectionId":"acid/acid-base","unitId":"acid","subject":"chemistry","text":"염의 가수분해는 구성 이온의 산·염기 성질을 따른다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"acid--acid-base-k008","sectionId":"acid/acid-base","unitId":"acid","subject":"chemistry","text":"다양성자산은 일반적으로 단계별 Ka가 감소하며 H₂A,HA⁻,A²⁻ 등의 분포는 pH와 pKa에 의존한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"acid--acid-base-k009","sectionId":"acid/acid-base","unitId":"acid","subject":"chemistry","text":"강산도 매우 묽으면 물의 자동이온화를 무시할 수 없다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"acid--acid-base-k010","sectionId":"acid/acid-base","unitId":"acid","subject":"chemistry","text":"pH=−log aH⁺; pKa=−log Ka.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"acid--acid-base-k011","sectionId":"acid/acid-base","unitId":"acid","subject":"chemistry","text":"Ka가 클수록 강산, 짝염기는 약해진다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"acid--acid-base-k012","sectionId":"acid/acid-base","unitId":"acid","subject":"chemistry","text":"Lewis 산 BF₃, Lewis 염기 NH₃.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"acid--acid-base-k013","sectionId":"acid/acid-base","unitId":"acid","subject":"chemistry","text":"25℃에서 pH+pOH≈14이다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]},{"id":"acid--acid-base-k014","sectionId":"acid/acid-base","unitId":"acid","subject":"chemistry","text":"[H⁺]≈10⁻³ M이므로 약 3이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["chemistry2e"]}]}